# CITATION.cff — https://citation-file-format.github.io/
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this ontology or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "PROTO — Proverbs & Tacit-knowledge Ontology"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An OWL ontology and accompanying dataset modeling proverbs, the tacit
  (unspoken) lessons they carry, the situations in which they are used,
  and the cross-cultural equivalences that link a proverb in one language
  to a proverb in another when they teach the same lesson.
authors:
